Generic single-database configuration for Alembic.

This is used for database migrations in the Distributed Job Processing Platform.

## Create a migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

## Apply migrations

```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

## Rollback migration

```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

## View migration history

```bash
alembic history
```
